            "notes": "## Round 1\n---\nYour first power should be [Bingo!](item_1234b16b-1426-4a0c-b6c3-213180336cc6). This allows you to farm abilities off the tank and generate a lot of stadium cash.  \nPlay normally, focus on cash generation above all. Intentionally dragging out the objective is a good idea. You do not need to win the round.  \n[Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) increases spam and lets you proc [Bingo!](item_1234b16b-1426-4a0c-b6c3-213180336cc6) more often.  \nUnsure if [Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318) can generate cash or not.  \n[Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) is pointless, with or without it, it takes 2 primary fires to kill a squishy.",
