            "notes": "## Round 2\n[Thermal Traps](item_eadfe43a-fe6d-438c-b4d7-0f78e6d7705e) is the first foray into the trap focus of the build. This is a crucial item for this build. If you place your traps in good spots, any enemy that steps in them will immediately have their predicament alerted to your entire team, who should take advantage of the situation.  \n[Wrist Wraps](item_19183386-c859-42ca-93f2-355d47d01e36) may seem like an odd choice, but the bonus attack speed lets us refresh abilities faster, and the 5% ability power is more important than the 5% movement speed of [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054).  \nIf you have spare cash I'd recommend [Ammo Reserves](item_982d53aa-5ef4-493f-93e7-9e374d0ebf34) or [Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318).  \nThe build is not fully online just yet so ability power is not a heavy focus.",
